{"html":"<header class=\"spec-title-strip\">\n<div class=\"spec-title-col\">\n<div class=\"spec-family-crumb\">\n            FAMILY 15 · <span class=\"lang-zh\">图神经网络：当边、拓扑和关系本身就是医学信息</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Graph &amp; Mesh Networks</span>\n</div>\n<h3 class=\"spec-model-title\" id=\"model_133_graphormer-title\">Graphormer</h3>\n<p class=\"spec-thesis-text lang-zh\">Graphormer 不做局部消息传递堆叠，而在全局 attention logits 中显式加入最短路径和边特征偏置。</p>\n<p class=\"spec-thesis-en lang-en\">Enables global all-pair Transformer self-attention over graphs by injecting degree centrality encodings into nodes and shortest-path spatial + edge-feature biases into attention logits.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"spec-tensor-col\">\n<div class=\"tensor-row\">\n<span class=\"tensor-kicker\">INPUT DOMAIN // 输入域</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val lang-zh\">带节点属性和边属性的图</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val tensor-val-en lang-en\">Attributed graph G=(V,E) with node features, edge features, node degrees, and all-pair shortest-path distances</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"tensor-row\">\n<span class=\"tensor-kicker\">OUTPUT TARGET // 输出目标</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val lang-zh\">节点上下文表示与 graph-level prediction</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val tensor-val-en lang-en\">Globally contextualized node representations and graph-level predictions</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n</header><div class=\"model-full-body\">\n<!-- Main Split: Original Figure Plate (Left) + Forward Computation Graph (Right) -->\n<div class=\"spec-blueprint-grid\">\n<section class=\"spec-figure-plate\">\n<div class=\"plate-header\">\n<div class=\"plate-header-left\">\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">PRIMARY FIGURE // Figure 1 · PDF p.3</span>\n<h4 class=\"plate-title\">\n<span class=\"lang-zh\">论文原始架构图</span>\n<span class=\"lang-en\">Original Paper Architecture Diagram</span>\n</h4>\n</div>\n<div class=\"plate-header-right\">\n<a class=\"plate-source-link\" href=\"https://proceedings.neurips.cc/paper/2021/hash/f1c1592588411002af340cbaedd6fc33-Abstract.html\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>SOURCE PDF</span><svg class=\"ui-icon-xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M7 17L17 7M9 7h8v8\"></path></svg></a>\n<button class=\"plate-zoom-btn\" data-call-click=\"openLightbox('architecture_model_133_graphormer')\" type=\"button\"><svg class=\"ui-icon\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M15 3h6v6M9 21H3v-6M21 3l-7 7M3 21l7-7\"></path></svg><span>FULLSCREEN LIGHTBOX</span></button>\n</div>\n</div>\n<figure class=\"arch-figure-box\" data-call-click=\"openLightbox('architecture_model_133_graphormer')\" title=\"Click to open interactive pan &amp; zoom viewer\">\n<img alt=\"Graphormer original paper architecture figure, Figure 1\" class=\"arch-figure-img\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/12712389bae30220ea9a.avif\"/>\n<figcaption class=\"plate-caption\">CLICK FIGURE TO OPEN INTERACTIVE PAN &amp; ZOOM VIEWER · Figure 1 · PDF p.3</figcaption>\n</figure>\n</section>\n<aside class=\"spec-circuit-panel\">\n<div class=\"circuit-header\">\n<div>\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">COMPUTATION GRAPH // 8 STAGES</span>\n<h4 class=\"plate-title\">\n<span class=\"lang-zh\">架构前向计算节点拆解</span>\n<span class=\"lang-en\">Forward Pass Computation Nodes</span>\n</h4>\n</div>\n<div class=\"circuit-controls\">\n<button class=\"circuit-btn\" data-call-click=\"stepArchNode('architecture_model_133_graphormer', -1)\" title=\"Previous Stage\" type=\"button\">◁</button>\n<button class=\"circuit-btn circuit-play-btn\" data-play-id=\"architecture_model_133_graphormer\" data-call-click=\"toggleAutoPlayNodes('architecture_model_133_graphormer')\" title=\"Auto-Trace Computation Graph\" type=\"button\">AUTO</button>\n<button class=\"circuit-btn\" data-call-click=\"stepArchNode('architecture_model_133_graphormer', 1)\" title=\"Next Stage\" type=\"button\">▷</button>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"active-node-spotlight\" id=\"spotlight-architecture_model_133_graphormer\">\n<span class=\"spotlight-badge\">\n                STAGE 01 / 08 · <span class=\"lang-zh\">Attributed graph</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Attributed graph</span>\n</span>\n<span class=\"spotlight-text lang-zh\">节点特征、边特征与邻接结构</span>\n<span class=\"spotlight-text spotlight-text-en lang-en\">Ingests attributed graph g=(v,e) with node features, edge features, node degrees, and all-pair shortest-path distances and prepares initial tensor representations (Attributed graph).</span>\n</div>\n<ol class=\"circuit-timeline\">\n<li class=\"circuit-node active\" data-node-desc=\"节点特征、边特征与邻接结构\" data-node-desc-en=\"Ingests attributed graph g=(v,e) with node features, edge features, node degrees, and all-pair shortest-path distances and prepares initial tensor representations (Attributed graph).\" data-node-idx=\"0\" data-node-name=\"Attributed graph\" data-node-name-en=\"Attributed graph\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_133_graphormer', 0)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">01</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>Attributed graph</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">节点特征、边特征与邻接结构</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Ingests attributed graph g=(v,e) with node features, edge features, node degrees, and all-pair shortest-path distances and prepares initial tensor representations (Attributed graph).</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"把离散/连续节点属性映射到 Transformer 维度\" data-node-desc-en=\"Executes Node feature embedding to extract primary structural features and establish spatial/sequence encoding.\" data-node-idx=\"1\" data-node-name=\"Node feature embedding\" data-node-name-en=\"Node feature embedding\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_133_graphormer', 1)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">02</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>Node feature embedding</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">把离散/连续节点属性映射到 Transformer 维度</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Executes Node feature embedding to extract primary structural features and establish spatial/sequence encoding.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"入度/出度 embedding 加到节点 token，表达节点重要性\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs Centrality encoding within the core structural bias global graph transformer computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"2\" data-node-name=\"Centrality encoding\" data-node-name-en=\"Centrality encoding\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_133_graphormer', 2)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">03</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>Centrality encoding</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">入度/出度 embedding 加到节点 token，表达节点重要性</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs Centrality encoding within the core structural bias global graph transformer computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"节点对最短路径距离作为 attention bias\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs Shortest-path spatial encoding within the core structural bias global graph transformer computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"3\" data-node-name=\"Shortest-path spatial encoding\" data-node-name-en=\"Shortest-path spatial encoding\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_133_graphormer', 3)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">04</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>Shortest-path spatial encoding</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">节点对最短路径距离作为 attention bias</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs Shortest-path spatial encoding within the core structural bias global graph transformer computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"聚合最短路径上的边特征并注入节点对注意力\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs Edge encoding within the core structural bias global graph transformer computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"4\" data-node-name=\"Edge encoding\" data-node-name-en=\"Edge encoding\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_133_graphormer', 4)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">05</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>Edge encoding</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">聚合最短路径上的边特征并注入节点对注意力</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs Edge encoding within the core structural bias global graph transformer computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"与所有节点交互以收集整图表示\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs Virtual graph token within the core structural bias global graph transformer computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"5\" data-node-name=\"Virtual graph token\" data-node-name-en=\"Virtual graph token\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_133_graphormer', 5)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">06</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>Virtual graph token</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">与所有节点交互以收集整图表示</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs Virtual graph token within the core structural bias global graph transformer computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"每对节点可直接交互，同时加结构 bias\" data-node-desc-en=\"Applies Global self-attention blocks to project aggregated representations toward the target task head.\" data-node-idx=\"6\" data-node-name=\"Global self-attention blocks\" data-node-name-en=\"Global self-attention blocks\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_133_graphormer', 6)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">07</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>Global self-attention blocks</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">每对节点可直接交互，同时加结构 bias</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Applies Global self-attention blocks to project aggregated representations toward the target task head.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"读取 graph token 或节点表示完成图级/节点级任务\" data-node-desc-en=\"Produces globally contextualized node representations and graph-level predictions via Graph prediction head.\" data-node-idx=\"7\" data-node-name=\"Graph prediction head\" data-node-name-en=\"Graph prediction head\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_133_graphormer', 7)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">08</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>Graph prediction head</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">读取 graph token 或节点表示完成图级/节点级任务</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Produces globally contextualized node representations and graph-level predictions via Graph prediction head.</span></div></li>\n</ol>\n</aside>\n</div>\n<!-- Mathematical Formalism Band -->\n<section aria-label=\"Graphormer Mathematical Formalism\" class=\"spec-math-band\">\n<div class=\"math-meta-col\">\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">MATHEMATICAL FORMALISM</span>\n<div class=\"math-title-text lang-zh\">核心公式 · 中心性、最短路与边编码注入图注意力</div>\n<div class=\"math-title-en lang-en\">Core Formalism · Graph Structural Bias Injection into Self-Attention Logits: (q_i k_j^T)/√d + b_{φ(v_i,v_j)} + c_{ij}</div>\n</div>\n<div aria-label=\"Graphormer：核心公式 · 中心性、最短路与边编码注入图注意力\" class=\"tex-formula-vector\" role=\"img\">\n<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" data-formula-index=\"133\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"25.003901pt\" preserveaspectratio=\"xMidYMid meet\" style=\"display:block;width:auto;max-width:100%;height:auto;max-height:96px;margin:0 auto\" version=\"1.1\" viewbox=\"-68.463972 -69.083544 302.404435 25.003901\" width=\"302.404435pt\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><defs><use id=\"m133_g10-112\" transform=\"scale(1.818182)\" xlink:href=\"