g20-103\" y=\"-52.316721\"></use><use x=\"215.995526\" xlink:href=\"#m133_g20-101\" y=\"-52.316721\"></use><use x=\"219.806408\" xlink:href=\"#m133_g7-185\" y=\"-52.316721\"></use><use x=\"222.591855\" xlink:href=\"#m133_g13-56\" y=\"-52.316721\"></use><use x=\"225.359122\" xlink:href=\"#m133_g13-150\" y=\"-52.316721\"></use><use x=\"228.75548\" xlink:href=\"#m133_g13-57\" y=\"-52.316721\"></use><use x=\"231.875478\" xlink:href=\"#m133_g7-186\" y=\"-52.316721\"></use></g></svg>\n</div>\n</section>\n<!-- 5-Column Swiss Specification Matrix -->\n<div class=\"spec-evo-matrix\">\n<div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-bottleneck\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">01 // PRIOR LIMITATION</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">上一代瓶颈</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">普通 Transformer 忽略图拓扑，消息传递 GNN 长程传播易过平滑</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Message-passing GNNs are bounded by the 1-WL isomorphism test and suffer from over-squashing across long graph bottlenecks.</p></div><div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-idea\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">02 // CORE HYPOTHESIS</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">核心想法</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">把最短路径距离、节点中心性和边特征作为 attention bias 注入 Transformer</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Allow every node to attend to every other node globally while encoding graph topology directly as additive biases inside the softmax attention matrix.</p></div><div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-improvement\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">03 // ARCHITECTURAL DELTA</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">关键改进</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">以结构编码让全局 self-attention 保留图归纳偏置</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Centrality encoding + Shortest-Path Distance (SPD) spatial bias + multi-hop edge feature encoding along shortest paths.</p></div><div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-adaptation\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">04 // MEDICAL TRANSLATION</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">医学适配</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">适用于分子、细胞相互作用、脑网络和患者关系图</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Excels on molecular property prediction, drug discovery, protein structure, and compact brain region connectome graphs (~100–500 ROIs).</p></div><div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-evidence\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">05 // EVIDENCE &amp; BOUNDARY</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">适用范围与证据</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">图 Transformer 代表；O(N²) 成本和拓扑构造限制大医学图扩展</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Leading Graph Transformer; O(N²) all-pair attention and shortest-path computation prohibit direct application to 100,000-node WSI cell graphs.</p></div>\n</div>\n<!-- 2-Column Design Principles & Medical Translation Band -->\n<div class=\"spec-dual-band\">\n<section class=\"spec-dual-col\">\n<div class=\"cell-kicker\">ARCHITECTURAL AXIOMS // 设计原理与数学机制</div>\n<ul class=\"spec-bullet-list\"><li class=\"lang-zh\">保留全局 self-attention，但用图结构编码补回 Transformer 缺少的拓扑归纳偏置。</li><li class=\"lang-zh\">中心性编码作用于单节点，最短路径距离和边编码作用于节点对。</li><li class=\"lang-zh\">virtual graph token 作为可学习全局汇聚器，避免手工 mean pooling。</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Core Hypothesis: Allow every node to attend to every other node globally while encoding graph topology directly as additive biases inside the softmax attention matrix.</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Architectural Delta: Centrality encoding + Shortest-Path Distance (SPD) spatial bias + multi-hop edge feature encoding along shortest paths.</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Mathematical Formalism: Graph Structural Bias Injection into Self-Attention Logits: (q_i k_j^T)/√d + b_{φ(v_i,v_j)} + c_{ij}.</li></ul>\n</section>\n<section class=\"spec-dual-col\">\n<div class=\"cell-kicker\">CLINICAL TRANSLATION &amp; BOUNDARIES // 医学应用与安全边界</div>\n<ul class=\"spec-bullet-list\"><li class=\"lang-zh\">适用于分子、脑连接组、细胞相互作用和患者关系图等全局依赖任务。</li><li class=\"lang-zh\">全局注意力随节点数二次增长，且最短路径/构图规则可能把技术性边误当生物学关系。</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Clinical Translation: Excels on molecular property prediction, drug discovery, protein structure, and compact brain region connectome graphs (~100–500 ROIs).</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Evidence &amp; Safety Boundary: Leading Graph Transformer; O(N²) all-pair attention and shortest-path computation prohibit direct application to 100,000-node WSI cell graphs.</li></ul>\n</section>\n</div>\n<!-- Provenance Footer Bar -->\n<footer class=\"spec-footer-bar\">\n<div class=\"spec-footer-cell\">\n<span class=\"footer-kicker\">PRIMARY LITERATURE // 原始文献</span>\n<a class=\"spec-ext-link\" href=\"https://papers.nips.cc/paper/2021/file/f1c1592588411002af340cbaedd6fc33-Paper.pdf\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">\n<span>Do Transformers Really Perform Bad for Graph Representation?</span><svg class=\"ui-icon-xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M7 17L17 7M9 7h8v8\"></path></svg>\n</a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"spec-footer-cell\">\n<span class=\"footer-kicker\">OFFICIAL IMPLEMENTATION // 开源代码</span>\n<a class=\"spec-ext-link\" href=\"https://github.com/microsoft/Graphormer\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>作者/机构官方实现</span><svg class=\"ui-icon-xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M7 17L17 7M9 7h8v8\"></path></svg></a>\n</div>\n</footer>\n</div>"}
